; ==============================================================================
; Lin driver: readback.
; Printing, running effects and dispatching FFI used to be the core's.  They are
; an OBSERVATION of the reduced net, not reduction, so they are this driver's
; now (std/drivers/readback.c); the core keeps only the dispatchers.
; Loaded as early as `set_driver` exists: the prelude's own top-level forms are
; evaluated -- and observed -- as they are read, so the printer must be there.
; ==============================================================================
(set_driver "readback")
